# Sunday Stoop: a two-bar boom-bap groove over jazzy minor changes.
#   street beat --pattern examples/patterns/sunday-stoop.groove
#   street beat --pattern examples/patterns/sunday-stoop.groove --style lofi   (same groove, lo-fi kit)

title   Sunday Stoop
bpm     90
swing   62%
key     Dm
style   boombap
chords  Dm9 Gm7 | Bbmaj7 A7         # one chord per bar, cycled

#         1    2    3    4      1    2    3    4
kick    | x..o ..x. ..o. .... | x..o .... ..o. x..o |
snare   | .... x..g .g.. x... | .... x..g .... x.gx |
hat     | o.o. o.o. o.o. o.o. | o.o. o.o. o.o. o... |
openhat | .... .... .... .... | .... .... .... ..o. |
bass    | x..o ..x. ..o. .... | x..o .... ..o. x..o |
keys    | x... .... ..o. .... | x... ...o .... .... |
